<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Tell Me</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Teo Glacier</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Tell Me</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">34R2RCXgGbCnMrCCOF4n6g</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:07.500" end="00:12.160">Left me a lil letter on the bedside</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:12.160" end="00:16.260">Guess I shoulda known better than to let you slide</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.260" end="00:20.010">Mood changed like the weather and you took your time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.010" end="00:23.460">To let me know, let me know</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.460" end="00:26.990">You wasn't feelin' the way you felt in the</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.990" end="00:32.550">Beginning, ain't no way I let you slip away like that</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.550" end="00:36.560">I'm tryna understand</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.560" end="00:41.290">Tell me what I did to deserve this</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.290" end="00:45.180">I thought what we had was working</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.180" end="00:49.210">It was all a fad, now it's worthless</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.210" end="00:53.180">Now I'm sitting sad and alone and I know</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.180" end="00:57.830">That I won't get you back and you don't give no damns about me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.830" end="01:01.430">Thought you was my last but you switched up and got way too selfish</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.430" end="01:05.230">I don't know how to act when my friends ask me about you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.230" end="01:10.380">You were my person, now I don't know how I feel about you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.380" end="01:14.500">So many ways to feel right now</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.500" end="01:18.420">I lost my way when I was with you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.420" end="01:23.020">Now it's too late to take those feelings...back</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.020" end="01:25.020">Wish that I could</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.020" end="01:26.810">Let you know how I was feeling</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.810" end="01:30.020">I was over the moon ecstatic</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.020" end="01:33.740">Said "I love you" so many times it became a habit</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.740" end="01:36.000">But that ain't no more</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.000" end="01:40.180">It's just a memory, but I wish you would</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.180" end="01:43.670">Tell me what I did to deserve this</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.670" end="01:47.490">Thought what we had was working</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.490" end="01:51.610">It was all a fad, now it's worthless</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:51.610" end="01:55.520">Now I'm sitting sad and alone cuz I know</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.520" end="02:00.170">That I won't get you back and you don't give no damns about me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.170" end="02:03.870">Thought you was my last but you switched up and got way too selfish</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.870" end="02:07.680">I don't know how to act when my friends ask me about you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.680" end="02:14.570">You were my person, now I don't know how I feel about you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.570" end="02:18.380">You, ohh, ah-ah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:18.380" end="02:21.840">You</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:21.840" end="02:25.590">I don't know how I feel</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:25.590" end="02:29.120">Feel about you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:29.120" end="02:33.120" /></div></body></tt>